  "boundaries": [
    "Schema116 adds one coalesced wake head per retained immutable push binding, with at most64 event fingerprints; no message plaintext or new encryption format.",
    "Exact duplicates within the bounded receipt window do not advance the head. Older retries can wake again; Matrix and client original identity remain authoritative. No exactly-once FCM claim.",
